@namespace Parrot.Web.Components.Layout.Auth

@* The ambient glow behind Sign In and Sign Up only: four edges, one per story
   colour, cross-fading on the story's beat. Kept very subtle in both themes.
   The other signed-out pages (reset, verify, the Google landing) have no
   gradient at all.

   Render it as the first child of the page's <main>, which must be
   position: relative. Dark mode swaps the strength in app.css, where the
   theme on :root can be seen. *@

<span class="auth-glow edge-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="auth-glow edge-violet" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="auth-glow edge-amber" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="auth-glow edge-pink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
